omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jaauZ78jgNkQ7kNvwHfxCXa&_nc_oc=AdpSimt1e5af5ZWFlGugvMRX2ZFrFUZQ6VKcFmh_7-HX7nPquRJKdg0tlGOyq1tRLr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFoxa4cmv4pLh4x7B3r_CZTZ2ervluf1tEcr0LhIsgZQ&oe=6A74A6B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E-MpLtgYOHgQ7kNvwGohuBC&_nc_oc=Adpartt1qRI8o-wBthLNi551Kk-05NdXLZ8UoBobgYbTVHd52EqHGtsNmjf2vuaXT38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG9Chip_eZd8BA3X3akJFakpk9I-AZK8duARCY-zNJuaQ&oe=6A746FD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yFUALCVBVGsQ7kNvwFB4Odt&_nc_oc=AdoO38T2-AwxcPv1H1ujlUGXRbmUk1riyjLxXgfB-l1YwT4ulhfn1iHTdL_U0MwwZZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGPb17qZcaH3KpO3HhoKjZPpOZMAwO2UDTIeGXndorng&oe=6A7484F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://